    <p class="hero-bio">
      Dr. Vo received the B.Eng. degree in Electronics and Telecommunications from HCMC University of Technology, Vietnam, in 1999, 
      the M.Sc. degree in Telecommunications (Radio Electronics) from HCMC University of Technology, Vietnam, in 2003, and 
      the Ph.D. degree in Computer Engineering from Kyung Hee University, Korea, in 2014. 
      She is currently an Associate Professor and Head of the IT Department at International University, Vietnam National University Ho Chi Minh City. 
      She has been a researcher at the School of Computer Science and Engineering, International University, since 2007, 
      and worked in industry from 1998 to 2007.
    </p>
